NAME
    wmpair - multi-window WM client demo (Path C phase 16)

SYNOPSIS
    wmpair [SECONDS]

DESCRIPTION
    Open TWO WM windows from a single process to demonstrate
    session-122's per-task VA bump allocator.  Both surfaces are
    mapped at distinct user VAs in the same task; the kernel-side
    WM table tracks them independently and wmd composites both.

    pair-A: teal background, white tick counter
    pair-B: magenta background, yellow tick counter

    Closing either window via its WM close-X exits the whole
    program (both surfaces are torn down).

    Exit after SECONDS (default 20).

SEE ALSO
    wmd(1), wmhello(1)
